menu "Volvo iPod USB device"

    config IPOD_USB_ENABLE
        bool "Enable iPod USB device (UAC1 + HID iAP)"
        default y
        help
            Present as an iPod (05AC:1261) with UAC1 audio streaming
            (device->host) and HID iAP transport. Takes over the native
            USB port (GPIO19/20); the USB-Serial/JTAG console goes quiet
            while enabled. Disable for AirPlay-only bench testing.

endmenu
